{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36806","headline":"送梅处士归宁国 · 罗隐","name":"送梅处士归宁国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五年前即别君，别时天下未纷纭。\n乱罹且喜身俱在，存没那堪耳更闻。\n良会谩劳悲曩迹，旧交谁去吊荒坟。\n殷勤爲谢逃名客，想望千秋岭上云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}